## Model card (facts only)

- **Name:** Ling 3.0 Flash Santé (`Ling-3.0-flash-Santé`)
- **Short description:** InclusionAI's health/medicine domain fine-tune of Ling-3.0-flash (124B total / 5.1B active MoE, 262K context). Proprietary API checkpoint — not MIT — with weights not released on Hugging Face.
- **Provider / access:** OpenRouter `openrouter/inclusionai/ling-3.0-flash-sante` (Chat Completions API; reasoning, tools, structured outputs accepted) and Vercel AI Gateway — both serverless routes. ModelScope listing: `inclusionAI/Ling-3.0-Flash-Sante` (weights not released).
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-09-04 release (LLM Reference); knowledge cutoff not stated.
- **IDs:** `openrouter/inclusionai/ling-3.0-flash-sante` (Free route), `vercel-ai-gateway/ling-3.0-flash-sante` (Free); no Free ID on OpenCode Zen verified.
- **Context window:** 262K tokens (LLM Reference specs) — no first-party docs page verified.
- **Modalities:** text in / text out presumed (no modality claims verified); reasoning yes; tool calls yes; JSON/structured outputs yes.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-09):** Free ($0 in/out) on both OpenRouter and Vercel AI Gateway routes (LLM Reference provider price ladder).
- **Architecture:** 124B total / 5.1B activated MoE (fine-tune of Ling-3.0-flash); proprietary, commercial use conditional.

